// Emoji are names too, alone or mixed with letters, so an emoji right after a
// name is part of it: `${coins}💰` shows coins then the emoji. Sequences stay
// whole: a family tied by invisible joiners, a skin tone, the emoji selector,
// flags. Symbols below U+2300, such as ™ or ©, and keycaps stay text.

state
  coins: 3
  👨‍👩‍👧: "family"
  👍🏽: "thumb"
  ❤️: "heart"
  🇫🇷: "France"
  🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿: "England"
  龙🐉: "dragon"
  hero_👑2: "king"
  hp💖: 7

character 🐉
  name: Smaug

character Wow🎉
  name: Party

function 🎲()
  return 4

function heal(n)
  return hp💖 + n

beat Start
  🐉: Grrr.

  Wow🎉: What a party.

  Pieces are $👨‍👩‍👧, $👍🏽, $❤️, $🇫🇷, $🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿.

  Mixed are $龙🐉, $hero_👑2, ${🐉.name}, $Wow🎉.name.

  Coins are ${coins}💰 and $coins💰.

  Dragon is ${🐉.name}龙.

  Brand™: text.

  © 2026: text.

  Press #️⃣ to call.

  \🎉: escaped.

  Wow\🎉: escaped.

  Tagged <🎉>party</🎉> text.

  Keyed line. #🎉

  Function gives ${🎲()} ${heal(2)}.

  🌙()

  choice
    + ⭐
  -> 🌙

beat ⭐
  choice
    Star
      Picked.

beat 🌙
  Moon.

